OL,3,GNEWSAPeople's sentimental shoe memories
OL,4,Acelebrated
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeoples' sentimental footwear,
OL,7,Fincluding wedding shoes and a special
OL,8,Fretirement present, is being celebrated
OL,9,Fin a new exhibition.
OL,11,FSomerset's Clarks Shoemakers Museum in
OL,12,FStreet is marking its first anniversary
OL,13,Fby exhibiting footwear from local
OL,14,Fpeople that hold a unique memory.
OL,16,FThey have chosen 12 shoes from the
OL,17,Fcommunity, marking the 12 months that
OL,18,Fthe museum has been open.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
