OL,3,GNEWSAPeople's sentimental shoe memories
OL,4,Acelebrated
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiz Fox, who helped organise the
OL,7,Fexhibition, said: "They're all shoes
OL,8,Fthat evoke memories and have a close
OL,9,Fsentimental connection with times that
OL,10,Fhave passed."
